OL,3,GNEWSANew thunderstorm warnings for
OL,4,Aparts of UK as rain set to continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FMet Office yellow warnings will remain
OL,7,Fin force for most of Thursday as
OL,8,Fdownpours and thunderstorms move
OL,9,Fnorthwards across the UK.
OL,11,FSouthern England was first to see the
OL,12,Frain overnight, with a yellow warning
OL,13,Fcontinuing until 08:00 BST in the
OL,14,Fsouth-east.
OL,16,FA wider warning area covers all of
OL,17,FWales and large swathes of England and
OL,18,Flasts until 22:00, with downpours
OL,19,Fbringing the risk of localised flash
OL,20,Fflooding and travel disruption.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
